    "html": "<div class=\"banner st-slice\" data-cycle=\"10000\">\n    <div class=\"layer sl-b\"><i class=\"bgimg\" style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-27606028-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"layer sl-a custom-out\" data-at=\"0\" data-out=\"5000\">\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:0;--dir:-1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:1;--dir:1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:2;--dir:-1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:3;--dir:1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:4;--dir:-1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:5;--dir:1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:6;--dir:-1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n      <div class=\"sl\" style=\"--i:7;--dir:1\"><i style=\"background-image:url('/banner11/px-13415305-2000.webp')\"></i></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"sl-panel\" data-at=\"150\" data-once>\n      <span class=\"kicker sl-kicker\">Kết nối</span>\n      <h3 class=\"sl-title\">Cung đường<br>ven biển</h3>\n      <p class=\"sl-sub\">Vừa đi vừa ngắm núi, ngắm biển – đường về Cam Lâm đẹp như một bức tranh.</p>\n      <a class=\"cta navy\" href=\"#\">Xem tuyến đường <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
