    "lop": "st-b8",
    "ten": "Mặt nước gợn sóng",
    "html": "<div class=\"banner st-b8\" data-cycle=\"9000\">\n    <div class=\"b8-panel\" data-at=\"0\" data-once>\n      <svg data-vbm=\"320 360 400 300\" viewBox=\"0 155 1000 508\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Thuyền thúng neo trên mặt nước gợn sóng\">\n        <defs>\n          <filter id=\"c12Rip\" filterUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"470\" width=\"1000\" height=\"193\" color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\">\n            <feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\"0.006 0.09\" numOctaves=\"2\" seed=\"3\" result=\"n\"><animate attributeName=\"baseFrequency\" dur=\"8s\" values=\"0.006 0.09;0.008 0.11;0.006 0.09\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/></feTurbulence>\n            <feDisplacementMap in=\"SourceGraphic\" in2=\"n\" scale=\"4\" xChannelSelector=\"R\" yChannelSelector=\"G\"/>\n          </filter>\n          <linearGradient id=\"c12Band\" gradientUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"476\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"663\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fff\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/><stop offset=\".58\" stop-color=\"#fff\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#fff\"/></linearGradient>\n          <mask id=\"c12Mask\" maskUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" x=\"0\" y=\"470\" width=\"1000\" height=\"193\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"476\" width=\"1000\" height=\"187\" fill=\"url(#c12Band)\"/></mask>\n        </defs>\n        <image href=\"/banner11/un-165577604042-2000.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"662.5\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\"/>\n        <g mask=\"url(#c12Mask)\"><image href=\"/banner11/un-165577604042-2000.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"662.5\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" filter=\"url(#c12Rip)\"/></g>\n        <use class=\"b8-sp\" data-at=\"1500,5200\" href=\"#star\" x=\"163\" y=\"578\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\"/>\n        <use class=\"b8-sp\" data-at=\"2100,5900\" href=\"#star\" x=\"444\" y=\"598\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"/>\n        <use class=\"b8-sp\" data-at=\"2800,6600\" href=\"#star\" x=\"676\" y=\"562\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\"/>\n        <use class=\"b8-sp\" data-at=\"3500,7300\" href=\"#star\" x=\"870\" y=\"532\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"/>\n        <use class=\"b8-sp\" data-at=\"4200,8000\" href=\"#star\" x=\"318\" y=\"628\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"/>\n      </svg>\n    </div>\n    <svg class=\"b8-edge\" data-at=\"600\" data-once viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.00 0C11.41 1.67 9.58 6.67 8.49 10.00C7.40 13.33 6.38 16.67 5.47 20.00C4.55 23.33 3.71 26.67 3.00 30.00C2.29 33.33 1.64 36.67 1.19 40.00C0.74 43.33 0.30 46.67 0.30 50.00C0.30 53.33 0.74 56.67 1.19 60.00C1.64 63.33 2.29 66.67 3.00 70.00C3.71 73.33 4.55 76.67 5.47 80.00C6.38 83.33 7.40 86.67 8.49 90.00C9.58 93.33 11.41 98.33 12.00 100.00\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5eead4\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/></svg>\n    <div class=\"b-text\" style=\"max-width:calc(var(--u)*600px)\">\n      <span class=\"kicker fx-up\" data-at=\"200\" data-once>Làng chài ven biển</span>\n      <h3 class=\"b-title lines\" data-at=\"400\" data-once><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"li\" style=\"--i:0\">Thuyền về bến,</span></span><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"li\" style=\"--i:1\">biển lặng sóng</span></span></h3>\n      <p class=\"b-sub fx-up\" data-at=\"900\" data-once>Nhịp sống làng chài yên ả, biển xanh ngay trước ngõ.</p>\n      <div class=\"fx-pop\" data-at=\"1300\" data-once><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#\">Xem đất ven biển <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
